# Callback / Retrollamada?

love.load <#load>
+ love.load( arg, unfilteredArg ) 
	* Se ejecuta una vez que inicia el juego o la aplicación
	Function is used to load any necessary variables structures etc, which will be used in the
		development of the programs(game).

	```
	love.load( arg ) -- Command line arguments given to the game. table arg
	```

	~~~
	function love.load()
	   hamster = love.graphics.newImage("hamster.png")
	   x = 50
	   y = 50
	end

	function love.draw()
	   love.graphics.draw(hamster, x, y)
	end
	~~~

This function is called exactly once at the beginning of the game.
-- arg	table
-- unfilteredArg	table
Command-line arguments given to the game.
Unfiltered command-line arguments given to the executable (see #Notes).



